eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1dWmzOc9d1IQ7kNvwEYapMP&_nc_oc=AdmfkAy8ezpeJO57XVnmMDWHTFOtwYzWea4PXBCpeHEbIAFnSy-zfWAhHtYanckG7eE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsM81VjCaBnhURQL9MJN6ZePXIA0tkMObxkAYa6O_5wuA&oe=6999A44D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2HIFVQIlGIkQ7kNvwHnPpwG&_nc_oc=AdmFdrliR-NpdO-Fllv8MZzg1M2JmAhjjYsLOvRFe7mjTseeCMb5v3VabNgRXkGzw1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftiKOZ8Q3bjXkUzl3pIv9LnsUetkSGEHhxZWGeZOpP54w&oe=699996AC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zS0dJKzUa3IQ7kNvwFxEC5q&_nc_oc=AdnrhqUUoNfQPxf2YAdRX-ojBAvWcDOZOSZUo6TPqi4n93FwF3R4hsJNH7F13YQmzCs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsVnRnYU6KUspchefuFGMQt1MTbPeGdVpXH32agbzchIA&oe=6999B83D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kgn8HgkOqsMQ7